flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1039347Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1040014Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1041179Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1041628Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1042005Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1043431Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1044004Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1044379Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1045161Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1045520Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1046131Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1046840Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1047608Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1048058Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1048294Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1048553Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1048877Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1049122Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1049612Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1049778Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1049922Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1050629Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1051004Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1051593Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
