flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1053403Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1053745Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1054137Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1054859Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1055322Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1055770Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1056075Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1056389Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1056814Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1057216Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1069055Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1069928Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1081180Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T11:21:09.1082002Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
